# Directory Structure Autaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaomation using Batch File

This repository contains a Windows Batch Script (`.bat`) designed to automate the creation of a standardized folder structure for ICT-related coursework or projects.

## 📂 Project Description

The script helps users quickly create and organize directories named `Critieria_1` to `Critieria_6`, each containing a set of subdirectories (`Standar_1`, `Standar_2`, etc.), using basic CMD commands.

---

## 📜 Script Overview

- Uses `mkdir` to create folders
- Uses `cd` to navigate between directories
- Fully commented for educational purposes
- Demonstrates use of comments in `.bat` files using `::`

